## Original Content
There’s no clearer sign of the data center boom than rampant gas projects that have been proposed or that are already under construction.

## Summary
The US is experiencing a surge in proposed and under-construction gas power projects, largely driven by the rapid expansion of data centers. This boom highlights the significant energy demands of the tech industry. The growth underscores concerns over energy sustainability and environmental impact.

